{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03923","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得月字 · 韦元旦","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得月字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云物开千里，天行乘九月。\n丝言丹凤池，斾转苍龙阙。\n灞水欢娱地，秦京游侠窟。\n欣承解愠词，圣酒黄花发。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦元旦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}